   "source": "---\nlayout: post\ntitle: Friends of the Poway Library - Library Tour\ndescription: Explore the Poway Library in this interactive tour. Meet the librarian and volunteer, discover the bookstore, and learn how to get involved!\npermalink: /fopl-pathway-game\ncodemirror: true\nhide: true\ntoc: false\n---"
