  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "fopl-intro",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "## About This Game\n\n**Controls:** `W A S D` to move &nbsp;|&nbsp; `E` to interact with characters\n\nExplore two levels:\n- **Level 1 — Library Welcome:** Arrive outside and meet the librarian.\n- **Level 2 — Cozy Library:** Step inside, meet the volunteer, and learn about the bookstore and how to get involved.\n\n---\n\n> **Friends of the Poway Library** &nbsp;|&nbsp; 13137 Poway Rd, Poway CA 92064 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 858-513-2862 &nbsp;|&nbsp; [powayfriends.org](https://powayfriends.org)"
  }
